* fibonacci -- the naive doubly-recursive Fibonacci, printed as a table for 0..16.
* bottleneck: recursive program-defined function call depth.
        DEFINE('fib(n)')                                :(fib_end)
fib     fib = LT(n, 2) n                                :S(RETURN)
        fib = fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)                   :(RETURN)
fib_end k = 0
row     OUTPUT = 'fib(' k ') = ' fib(k)
        k = LT(k, 16) k + 1                             :S(row)
END
